OL,3,GNEWSA'We found a foot sticking through
OL,4,Athe ceiling of our bar'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEddie Skelson used to manage an iconic
OL,7,Fnightclub and remembers the time one of
OL,8,Fhis security team radioed to say there
OL,9,Fwas something he needed to see
OL,10,Furgently.
OL,12,F"Ed, we've got a foot sticking out of
OL,13,Fthe ceiling," recalled the 59-year-old,
OL,14,Fwho, at the time, thought it was a
OL,15,Fwind-up.
OL,17,FBut it turned out there really was a
OL,18,Fhuman body part poking through into the
OL,19,Fcocktail bar at The Place, as a
OL,20,Fteenager had tried to get in through an
OL,21,Fair-conditioning shaft on the roof and
OL,22,Fgot stuck.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
