OL,3,GNEWSA'We found a foot sticking through
OL,4,Athe ceiling of our bar'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople always tried to sneak in, he
OL,7,Fsaid, not normally because they did not
OL,8,Fwant to pay, more often because they
OL,9,Fwere drunk or had been barred.
